name: Eight reviewed scopes over 4105 files reach bounded native discovery, triage and report
size: 120x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE NODE_OPTIONS NO_COLOR SEMGREP_APP_TOKEN SEMGREP_AGENT_TOKEN
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 SEMGREP_ENABLE_VERSION_CHECK=0
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/wide_semgrep.py @TMP_TARGET @ART @TMP_HOME seed
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
submit: setg ui.auto_open_activity false
submit: setg ui.auto_open_viz false
submit: logs
submit: run context:build {"enrichment":false}
require-live-snap: 45 Build project context: | bounded-context
submit: use threat-model
submit: options threat-model:import
submit: set path .kuzushi/manual-context.json
submit: set activate false
submit: set label Owned wide source policy
submit: run threat-model:import
require-live-snap: 35 threat-model:import saved | manual-source-context
submit: map
require-live-snap: 25 SYSTEM SUMMARY | map-result
nav-mode:
keys: u
require-live-snap: 25 Map ✓ | accepted-map
submit: use sast
submit: options sast:scan
submit: set taskMode manual
submit: set tasks semgrep
paste-file: @ART/rule-setting.txt
keys: Enter
paste-file: @ART/binary-setting.txt
keys: Enter
submit: set semgrepJobs 1
submit: set semgrepTimeoutMs 60000
submit: scopes
require-live-snap: 30 DRAFT SCOPES | eight-scopes
expect: 513 files
keys: f
require-live-snap: 25 Files 1..32 of 513 | first-members
keys: End
require-live-snap: 25 Files 513..513 of 513 | final-member
expect: z-owner-policy.py
resize: 160x48
require-live-snap: 15 Home/End first/last | files-160x48
resize: 96x89
require-live-snap: 15 Home/End first/last | files-96x89
resize: 80x24
require-live-snap: 15 Home/End first/last | files-80x24
resize: 60x20
require-live-snap: 15 Home/End first/last | files-60x20
resize: 40x12
require-live-snap: 15 z-owner-policy.py | files-40x12
keys: Home
require-live-snap: 25 Files 1..32 of 513 | first-members-40x12
ask: Can an operator reach the first and final exact members of a 513-file boundary at all sizes, with source limits disclosed and no scan started?
resize: 120x36
keys: Escape
require-live-snap: 15 Enter menu | file-reader-closed
keys: a
require-live-snap: 20 Accept exact boundaries | coverage-review
keys: Enter End Enter
require-live-snap: 30 ACCEPTED SCOPES | accepted-boundaries
keys: Space Down Space Down Space Down Space Down Space Down Space Down Space Down Space
require-live-snap: 20 8 boundaries marked | selected-boundaries
keys: p
require-live-snap: 25 PLAN A STUDY | finite-work
expect: 24 fixed discovery jobs
keys: Down Down Down Down Down Enter
require-live-snap: 20 Total calls | calls
type: 1
keys: Enter Down Enter
require-live-snap: 20 Protected review | protected-review
type: 1
keys: Enter L
require-live-snap: 45 Scope draft ready | frozen-work
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/wide_semgrep.py @TMP_TARGET @ART @TMP_HOME prepared
keys: L Home
require-live-snap: 25 REVIEW PLAN & ALLOWANCE | review-allowance
expect: 24 fixed jobs
keys: NPage
require-live-snap: 20 Scan workers within each job: 1 | scanner-resource-choice
keys: End
require-live-snap: 20 y approve | approval-tail
keys: y
require-live-snap: 25 Approval saved | approved
keys: L
require-live-snap: 25 L starts its fixed jobs | fixed-jobs
keys: L
require-live-snap: 25 dispatcher pid | running
submit: logs
require-live-snap: 15 LOGS | active-composer
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/wide_semgrep.py @TMP_TARGET @ART @TMP_HOME probe
live-snap: after-active-typing
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/wide_semgrep.py @TMP_TARGET @ART @TMP_HOME progress-8
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/wide_semgrep.py @TMP_TARGET @ART @TMP_HOME progress-16
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/wide_semgrep.py @TMP_TARGET @ART @TMP_HOME progress-24
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/wide_semgrep.py @TMP_TARGET @ART @TMP_HOME completed
ask: During actual source authentication and scanner activity, do typing and resize preserve Logs focus and the finite plan, with one scan worker per job and no provider request?
paste-file: @ART/resume-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 24 completed | completed-work
submit: workbench
require-live-snap: 25 Viewing Scan | scan-result
nav-mode:
keys: n
require-live-snap: 25 Viewing Review | accepted-scan
paste-file: @ART/open-a-0.txt
keys: Enter
submit: decision deferred Owned Service A policy review
paste-file: @ART/open-b-0.txt
keys: Enter
submit: decision deferred Owned Service B policy review
paste-file: @ART/open-c-0.txt
keys: Enter
submit: decision deferred Owned Service C policy review
paste-file: @ART/open-d-0.txt
keys: Enter
submit: decision deferred Owned Service D policy review
paste-file: @ART/open-e-0.txt
keys: Enter
submit: decision deferred Owned Service E policy review
paste-file: @ART/open-f-0.txt
keys: Enter
submit: decision deferred Owned Service F policy review
paste-file: @ART/open-g-0.txt
keys: Enter
submit: decision deferred Owned Service G policy review
paste-file: @ART/open-h-0.txt
keys: Enter
submit: decision deferred Owned H integration policy review
paste-file: @ART/open-h-1.txt
keys: Enter
submit: decision deferred Owned H second policy review
submit: report
require-live-snap: 25 9 findings · 9 reviewed | consolidated-report
expect: 8 boundaries
expect: 1 protected review remaining
keys: j j j
require-live-snap: 20 format json (4/6) | json-format
resize: 160x48
require-live-snap: 15 format json (4/6) | report-160x48
resize: 96x89
require-live-snap: 15 format json (4/6) | report-96x89
resize: 80x24
require-live-snap: 15 format json (4/6) | report-80x24
resize: 60x20
require-live-snap: 15 format json (4/6) | report-60x20
resize: 40x12
require-live-snap: 15 format json (4/6) | report-40x12
expect: findings.json
keys: PageDown
require-live-snap: 15 format json (4/6) | report-paged-40x12
expect: findings.json
keys: PageUp
resize: 120x36
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 EXPORTED | exported
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/wide_semgrep.py @TMP_TARGET @ART @TMP_HOME exported
ask: Does Report retain 27 raw observations, nine owner deferrals, per-scope three-pass recurrence, shared-context separation and resource evidence without a vulnerability or complete-coverage claim?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 SEMGREP_ENABLE_VERSION_CHECK=0 NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target @TMP_TARGET
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
paste-file: @ART/resume-command.txt
keys: Enter
require-live-snap: 25 24 completed | recovered-work
submit: report
require-live-snap: 25 9 findings · 9 reviewed | recovered-report
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/wide_semgrep.py @TMP_TARGET @ART @TMP_HOME restarted
ask: Does no-color restart preserve the same 24 jobs, 27 observations, nine decisions and unchanged 4105 source files, with no extra work or provider request?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
